4_700x700.jpeg)\n![Bhattad Aurus - Site Plan](https://teja10.kuikr.com//r1/20190128/ak_700_1856729934-1548667943_700x700.jpeg)\n\n# Bhattad Aurus by Bhattad Group [Borivali West](https://www.quikr.com/homes/locality/borivali_west-mumbai/107), Mumbai\n\n## BUY *₹* 1.56 Crore + Share\n\n### 0.95 Acres\n\n### 24 Units\n\n### 7 Floors\n\n### Ready to Occupy\n\n### 2,3 BHK Apartments\n\n# Bhattad Aurus by Bhattad Group [Borivali West](https://www.quikr.com/homes/locality/borivali_west-mumbai/107), Mumbai\n\n### 1.56 Crore +\n\n## Nearby Places and Landmarks\n\n## About Bhattad Aurus [View Similar Projects](javascript:void(0))\n\nLoaded with all world class amenities and strategically located, Bhattad Aurus is an address which only a people like, who are destined for eminence in life. The residents of these Residential Apartments in Mumbai enjoys a lifestyle that is sought by many and experienced by few. Bhattad Aurus in Borivali West offers you an elite lifestyle that you have always cherished. The floor plan of Bhattad Aurus enables best utilisation of space such that every room, kitchen, bathroom or balconies appear to be more bigger and spacious. Bhattad Aurus offers 2 BHK and 3 BHK luxurious Apartments in Mumbai. The master plan of Bhattad Aurus ensures that these Apartments in Borivali West are Vastu compliant to present its residents with a cheerful mood and blissful life throughout all seasons. Location of Bhattad Aurus is perfect for the ones who desire to invest in property in Mumbai with many schools, colleges, hospitals, supermarkets, recreational areas, parks and many other facilities nearby Borivali West. Currently Bhattad Aurus is completed and is sold. The price of Apartments in Bhattad Aurus starts from 1.56 crore.\n\nBhattad Aurus is Consist Min 1150 sqft. and 1830 sqft unit Size.\n\nAddress : R.M. Bhattad Road, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, INDIA..\n\nBank Approval : Axis Bank and LIC Housing Finance Ltd.\n\n## Floor Plan & Price List\n\n![Bhattad Aurus - Floor plan](https://teja10.kuikr.com//r1/20190128/ak_377_390701214-1548668157_300x300.jpeg)\n![Bhattad Aurus - Floor plan](https://teja10.kuikr.com//r1/20190128/ak_674_139953943-1548668172_300x300.jpeg)\n\n## Brochure\n\n![Project brochure](https://teja8.kuikr.com/restatic/build/image/icon_download.png)\n\nNeed more details about this Projects?\n\n#### Download the Brochure Now!\n\n## Bhattad Aurus Amenities\n\n## Project Specification\n\n**Internal Amenities**  \nVitrified tile flooring  \nAnodized aluminum sliding windows  \nJaquar or similar brand fittings  \nAntiskid vitrified tiled bathrooms  \nWindow frames in granite  \nGranite kitchen platform  \nTeak wood door frames with laminated door  \nPOP finish for internal walls  \nFalse ceiling in all rooms  \nConcealed wiring with branded switches\n\n**External Amenities**  \nRoof top meditation area  \nRoof top party area  \nChildren's play area  \nCovered car parking  \nFire fighting system  \n24 hours security with intercom facility  \nDry balcony for kitchen  \nRain water harvesting system\n\n## Gallery\n\n![Bhattad Aurus - project photo]()\n![Bhattad Aurus - project photo]()\n![Bhattad Aurus - Floor Plan]()\n![Bhattad Aurus - Floor Plan]()\n![Bhattad Aurus - Floor Plan]()\n![Bhattad Aurus - Floor Plan]()\n![Bhattad Aurus - Locality]()\n\n## Location\n\n## Bank Approval\n\n![Axis Bank]()\n![LIC Housing Finance Ltd]()\n\n## About Bhattad Group\n\n![builder logo]()\n\nBhattad Group endeavors to be India's most trusted Developer by delivering highest quality products coupled with the utmost customer satisfaction thereby enlarging their family with every new customer. A flourishing and large quantity of land cache has propelled Bhattad's into the business of real estate. The Group has entered into private equity partnerships for development of some of its land parcels. Understanding the need of the hour, Bhattad has immersed itself into constructing high end luxury projects to give you a complete package of state of the style sumptuous living.\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n## Similar Search\n\n## Discussion Board\n\n##### Discussions\n\nAre you Sure you want to Delete?\n\n## Bhattad Aurus in Borivali West, Mumbai, Price List\n\n### 2 BHK Apartment\n\n### 1150 Sq. Ft. (106.84 Sq.M)\n\n### ₹1.56 Crore\n\n### 2 BHK Apartment\n\n### 1200 Sq. Ft. (111.48 Sq.M)\n\n### ₹1.63 Crore\n\n### 3 BHK Apartment\n\n### 1780 Sq. Ft. (165.37 Sq.M)\n\n### ₹2.42 Crore\n\n### 3 BHK Apartment\n\n### 1830 Sq. Ft. (170.01 Sq.M)\n\n### ₹2.48 Crore\n\n![Bhattad Aurus](https://teja10.kuikr.com//r1/20170519/ak_227_1452993139-1495173391_80x80.jpeg)\n\n## Useful Links\n\nQuikrHomes is here to make your journey to a new home, simple and memorable. So we decided to bring you a platform which allows you to browse through millions of property listings across 900+ cities in India. You can now do a quick and convenient search for apartments, commercial properties, land-plots and other real estate properties in Bangalore. Now buying and renting comes with the freedom of ease and comfort. You can even refine your search results based on price, number of rooms, area size, locality and other relevant property amenities. And if you need any help, give us a call  08067364545\n\nThe information provided herein have been collected from publicly available sources, and is yet to be verified as per RERA guidelines.\\*\n[Read more..](javascript:void(0);)\n\nThe information sources used here include onsite interviews, marketing material and other information sources on the internet. The information related to ownership of this property are also based on material gathered from public sources mentioned above or as has been declared to us by the owners/person listing the property. These data have not yet been verified against authentic documents, and are only indicative of the actual situation of this property, project or land holding, and their ownership.\n\nAt QuikrHomes, we provide this information to help ou