%20West.%20Where%20is%20it%20in%20its%20cycle%2C%20and%20what%20are%20the%20best%20options%20right%20now%3F)\n\n## Building description\n\n### Building details\n\nAurus is a residential project in Borivali by Bhattat Group, all set to upgrade your lifestyle, as it is a new benchmark for opulent and spacious living.\n\n### About the building\n\nAurus is a 7 Storey Residential project in Borivali by Bhattad Group, all set to upgrade your lifestyle, as it is a new benchmark for opulent and spacious living. Commodious apartments adorned with a façade that suits the elegant life that will be lived at Aurus. Get Ready to embrace a new way of living that is soon to come your way.\n\n### About the location\n\nThis location is well connected on R. M. Bhattad Road, Borivali (W), which connects S. V. Road and Link Road. This area is well connected with a number of bus routes along with Borivali station which is less than 2 kms and Kandivali Station is less than 3 kms.\n\n### Building remarks\n\nMr.Darshan project is sold out...\n\n### Building ratings\n\n3.0\n\n★ ★ ★ ☆ ☆\n\nBuilding\n\n6.0\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ★\n\nLocation\n\n4.9\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nAmenities\n\n4.5\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nLegal\n\n4.7\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nValue for Money\n\n## Bhattad Group\n\n**Developer:** [Bhattad Group](/projects-in-bhattad-group)\n\n### More by Bhattad Group\n\n[Bhattad Augustine, Goregaon West](/project/bhattad-augustine-goregaon-west/6546)\n\n[Browse all projects in Borivali West →](/projects-in-borivali-west)\n\n## 📸 Building Gallery (9 images)\n\n![Main Image](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/6629/6629-main.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\nMain Image\n\n![Floor Plan](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/6629/6629-oth-floor-plan.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&anchor=topcenter)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n![Floor Plan](https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/6629/6629-oth-floor-plan-1-.webp?width=400&height=300&mode=crop&